-# Completeness of the metadata in the Edit page: the percentage of the fields of the Edit tabs that are filled
-# (SubmissionInputsHelper#completeness_percent), with the progress bar of EarthPortal colored by level (edit-ontology.scss)
- percent = completeness_percent(@recommended_values)
- if percent
  %div.completeness-bar.mb-3{class: "completeness-#{completeness_level(percent)}"}
    %div.edit-ontology-desc.mb-1= t('submission_inputs.completeness')
    = render Display::ProgressBarComponent.new(progress: percent.to_s)
